@startuml
title 3B - Linear: someone comments on an assigned ticket (NOT BUILT)\nWhat happens depends on the state the ticket is in

skinparam defaultTextAlignment left
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor Human
participant Linear
participant "LinearAdapter" as LA
participant "Orchestrator" as O
participant "Store" as S
participant "SandboxPool" as P

Human -> Linear: comment on the assigned issue
Linear -> LA: AgentSessionEvent/prompted
note right of LA
  Not built: a `prompted` session is acknowledged and dropped
  (`prompted_not_supported`), so nothing answers the human.
end note
LA -> O: LinearRequest{subject=linear:<issue>, actor, text}
O -> S: create RequestRouter instance
return rr_resolved
O -> S: which instance owns this issue, and in what state?
return instance + state

alt li_implementing / li_verifying (a run is live)
  O -> S: record pending human input
  return the run is NOT interrupted
  note right of O
    A pending human input BLOCKS the handoff: even a
    verdict_accept will not mark the PR ready until
    the comment is addressed.
  end note
  O -> Linear: post activity
  return "noted, will address"
else li_needs_human (open, waiting)
  O -> P: enqueue SandboxRun(LinearImplementer, feedback)
  O -> S: state
  return li_implementing
  note right of O
    The SAME instance advances. No new pass, no inherited
    context: this is the dead end that started the track.
  end note
else li_done (already merged)
  O -> Linear: post activity
  return "esto ya esta hecho, crea otro ticket"
else no instance (never delegated)
  O -> S: nothing to do
  return recorded on the request only
end
@enduml
